        "id": 18541,
        "name": "RySmith6",
        "username": "RySmith6",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rysmith6/{size}/1852_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-14T01:39:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sooo I just did some math, and there could be a SCRPG Live Issue 6 at PAX Unplugged if &gt;G pushes themselves a little:</p>\n<p>Season 2 Issue 2: September 19<br>\n\tSeason 2 Issue 3: September 26<br>\n\tSeason 2 Issue 4: October 3<br>\n\tSeason 2 Issue 5: October 10<br>\n\tSeason 2 Issue 6: October 17<br>\n\t&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Season 3 Character Creation: Week of Oct. 22<br>\n\tSeason 3 Issue 1: Week of October 29<br>\n\tSeason 3 Issue 2: Week of November 5<br>\n\tSeason 3 Issue 3: Week of November 12<br>\n\tSeason 3 Issue 4: Week of November 19<br>\n\tSeason 3 Issue 5: Week of November 26</p>\n<p><br>\n\tSeason 3 Issue 6: Weekend of November 30 -December 2</p>\n<p>Having missed the Live issue at Gen Con, I'd be very interested if they decide to do one at Unplugged, but I'm expecting them to take some time between seasons 2 and 3, so I guess we'll see!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:55.813Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
