        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-17T19:23:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We have decided that doing finales at conventions is suboptimal, because live-streaming from shows is always hard, and because it puts the final episode of a season at a different day and time from the other episodes, making it hard for everyone to watch it who had been enjoying it up to that point.</p>\n<p>However, we do plan to do one-off adventures at shows going forward! We currently plan to at Unplugged, but haven't worked out all of the details yet.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:07.209Z",
